Latency & Error Analytics: Provides visual charts showing which APIs are slow or failing often, helping you spot backend issues early.
Mock Response Builder: Allows you to define "fake" data for a tool so you can keep building your AI workflow even if the actual API isn't finished yet.
Auto-Fix Suggestions: Analyzes failed tool calls and suggests UI configuration changes (like switching from GET to POST) to fix the error automatically.

