 <!-- Section: What is it -->
 <div class="help-section">
 <h6><i class="fas fa-lightbulb me-2"></i>What is a Hierarchical Workflow?</h6>
 <p>A graph of AI agents working together. Data flows from node to node, with optional branching based on conditions.</p>
 <pre class="help-code">START → Agent A → Agent B → [Condition?] → Agent C or D → END</pre>
