Of course. Implementing a hierarchical multi-agent system in LangGraph is one of its core strengths. It allows you to create a "supervisor" or "manager" agent that intelligently routes tasks to a team of specialist agents. 

 Below is the complete langgraph_agent.py file, updated to include a new get_and_run_langgraph_with_agents function that perfectly mirrors the hierarchical logic from your crew_agent.py . The existing single-agent function remains unchanged. 

 The approach is to create a supervisor agent whose tools are the specialist agents themselves . The supervisor's only job is to analyze the query and delegate it to the correct specialist by calling the appropriate "tool". 

 ## Final, Complete langgraph_agent.py with Hierarchical Multi-Agent Logic 

