 <div class="card"><div class="card-header"><i class="bi bi-lightning me-2"></i>LOS API Request</div><div class="card-body"><div class="mb-3"><label class="form-label">CURL Command</label><pre id="losCurlCommand" class="bg-light p-3 rounded"></pre></div></div></div>
