assistant:
Of course. You're right, the chat area wasn't properly constrained, which prevented its scrollbar from activating. My apologies for that oversight. 

 The issue was that the card-body containing the chat window wasn't set to fill the full height of its parent card. I've applied the fix. 

 Here is the corrected index.html file. I've only made the one necessary change to fix the chat area's scrolling behavior. Both the sidebar and the chat area will now scroll independently as intended. 

 The Fix 

 I've added the h-100 class to the card-body in the right-hand column. This makes it fill its parent container, which in turn allows the chat window inside it to correctly calculate its own height and scroll when the content overflows. 

