 Timeout: Added timeout=60.0 to the client. Audio transcription services often take 10-20 seconds to respond; the default httpx timeout is often too short. 

 Raw Response Catch: If the API returns a string or an error page instead of JSON, you will now see the raw_response instead of an empty error. 

